											"value": {
												"html": {
													"value_i18n": {
														"en_US": "<div class=\"f-text font-size-paragraph-base\"><style>\n\t.company-description-container {\n\t\twidth: 846px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-description-icons-container {\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\tborder: solid 1.5px #E2E2E4;\n\t\twidth: 846px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-icon {\n\t\theight: 48px;\n\t\twidth: 48px;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-inner {\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\theight: 353px;\n\t\toverflow: hidden;\n\t\twidth: 682.99px;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-next, .carousel-control-prev {\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\ttransition: all .3s ease-in-out;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-next:hover, .carousel-control-prev:hover {\n\t\tbackground: rgb(0, 0, 0);\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-prev:hover {\n\t\tbackground: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 90%);\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\ttransition: all .3s ease-in-out;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-next:hover {\n\t\tbackground: linear-gradient(-90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 90%);\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\ttransition: all .3s ease-in-out;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-indicators li {\n\t\tborder-radius: 50%;\n\t\tborder: solid 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5) !important;\n\t\theight: 10px !important;\n\t\twidth: 10px !important;\n\t}\n</style>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t<div class=\"block-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"block-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center container d-flex flex-column\">\n\t<div>\n\t\t<h2>\n\t\t\tFortify Your Data Security &amp; Compliance\n\t\t</h2>\n\n\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t</p><h4><em>1.&nbsp;Strengthen Compliance Readiness</em></h4><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Support regulatory and organizational compliance initiatives through secure handling, masking, storage, and governance of sensitive digital assets.</p><h4><em>2.&nbsp;Automate Document Intelligence</em></h4><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Eliminate manual document verification by automatically identifying, classifying, and organizing masked, non-masked, and exception-based records.</p><h4><em>3.&nbsp;Improve Document Governance</em></h4><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Centralize enterprise documents and digital assets within a secure repository while maintaining visibility, accessibility, and governance controls.</p><h4><em>4.&nbsp;Accelerate Operational Efficiency</em></h4><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Reduce manual intervention through automated processing, classification, and validation of workflows that streamline enterprise document operations.</p><h4><em>5.&nbsp;Enhance Secure Collaboration</em></h4><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Enable employees to securely access, manage, review, and share documents while maintaining strict privacy and document governance standards.</p><h4 class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em>6.&nbsp;Reduce Compliance Risks</em></h4><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Minimize exposure to sensitive information through automated masking, document validation, and governance controls that support secure enterprise operations.</p>\n\t\t<p></p>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"block-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"block-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center container d-flex flex-column\">\n\t<div>\n\t\t<h2>\n\t\t\tCore Features of Surekha Technologies' Digital Asset Management with PII Masking\n\t\t</h2>\n\n\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t</p><h4 class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em>1.&nbsp;Centralized Asset Repository</em></h4><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Store, organize, and manage enterprise documents and digital assets securely within a centralized Liferay DXP environment.</p><h4 class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em>2.&nbsp;Automated PII Detection</em></h4><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Identify sensitive personal information across documents automatically to improve data security and reduce compliance risks.</p><h4 class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em>3.&nbsp;Aadhaar Data Masking</em></h4><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Detect and mask Aadhaar information within documents to protect sensitive data and support privacy compliance requirements.</p><h4 class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em>4.&nbsp;Smart Document Classification</em></h4><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Automatically classify documents into masked, non-masked, and exception categories to simplify validation and governance processes.</p><h4 class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em>5.&nbsp;Advanced File Preview</em></h4><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Preview ZIP, DOCX, XLSX, XLS, and EML files directly within Liferay DXP without downloading or extracting documents.</p><h4 class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em>6.&nbsp;Automated Document Workflows</em></h4><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Streamline document review, validation, masking, and approval processes through automated workflows and reduced manual effort.</p><h4 class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em>7.&nbsp;Compliance &amp; Governance Controls</em></h4><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Strengthen document security with controlled access, audit visibility, and governance policies for managing sensitive enterprise information.</p>\n\t\t<p></p>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div></div>"
													}
