														"en_US": "<div class=\"f-text font-size-paragraph-base\"><style>\n\t.catalog-icon {\n\t\twidth: 90px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-description-container {\n\t\twidth: 846px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-description-icons-container {\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\tborder: solid 1.5px #E2E2E4;\n\t\twidth: 846px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-icon {\n\t\theight: 48px;\n\t\twidth: 48px;\n\t}\n</style>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t<div class=\"block-container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center container d-flex flex-column\">\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img alt=\"Slide 0\" class=\"catalog-icon mb-8\" src=\"[$DOCUMENT_URL:/site-initializer/documents/group/solutions/digital-asset-management-with-pii-masking/007.png$]\">\n\n\t\t\t<h1 class=\"mb-6\">\n\t\t\t\tSurekha Technologies\n\t\t\t</h1>\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"company-description-container mb-6\">\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Incorporated in 2011, Surekha Technologies is an ISO-certified, official Liferay Silver Partner with a dual presence in the US and India. With over 15 years of profound experience, our dedicated teams provide round-the-clock, 24/7 support availability to ensure seamless enterprise portal operations.</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Our elite talent pool boasts 50+ certified Liferay developers who have successfully delivered more than 250+ global projects. As an active ecosystem contributor, we have published over 20+ high-performance applications on the official Liferay Marketplace to handle complex organizational and functional demands.</p><p>We focus entirely on delivering a specialized core suite of <a href=\"https://www.surekhatech.com/liferay-development-services\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(70, 120, 134);\"><strong><u>Liferay development services</u></strong></a>, custom DXP solutions architecture, and enterprise-grade platform upgrade &amp; migration management.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"bg-white company-description-icons-container d-flex justify-content-between px-8 py-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center d-flex mr-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"company-icon\" aria-label=\"video-thumbnail\" src=\"[$DOCUMENT_URL:/site-initializer/documents/group/solutions/digital-asset-management-with-pii-masking/008.png$]\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-column\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"m-0\">Website</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"font-weight-bold\" href=\"https://www.surekhatech.com/digital-asset-management\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\twww.surekhatech.com/digital-asset-management\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center d-flex mr-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"company-icon\" aria-label=\"video-thumbnail\" src=\"[$DOCUMENT_URL:/site-initializer/documents/group/solutions/digital-asset-management-with-pii-masking/009.png$]\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-column\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"m-0\">Email</h2>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"font-weight-bold\" href=\"mailto:sales@surekhatech.com\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsales@surekhatech.com\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center d-flex mr-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"company-icon\" aria-label=\"video-thumbnail\" src=\"[$DOCUMENT_URL:/site-initializer/documents/group/solutions/digital-asset-management-with-pii-masking/010.png$]\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-column\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"m-0\">Phone</h2>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"font-weight-bold\" href=\"tel:+14089142737\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+14089142737\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div></div>"
